From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: img,powervr-rogue: speed-bin nvmem cell

drm/imagination can select OPPs by the die's speed bin
(`drm-imagination-pick-the-opps-of-the-die-s-speed-bin`). Allow one nvmem
cell named "speed-bin"; the OPPs used are those whose opp-supported-hw has
BIT(speed bin) set.

Assisted-by: Claude
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
@@ -82,6 +82,16 @@
   "#cooling-cells":
     const: 2
 
+  nvmem-cells:
+    items:
+      - description:
+          The die's speed bin. Only the OPPs whose opp-supported-hw has bit
+          BIT(speed bin) set are used; a bin of 32 or more counts as 0.
+
+  nvmem-cell-names:
+    items:
+      - const: speed-bin
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
